<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<%- include("partials/head") %>

<body>

    <%- include("partials/navbar") %>

    <main class="about-page">

        <section class="about-hero">
            <div class="about-hero-content">
                <span class="about-label">ABOUT L-EASE</span>
                <h1>Making Asset Leasing Simple and Accessible</h1>
                <p>
                    L-Ease is a peer-to-peer asset leasing marketplace that
                    connects people who have assets with people who need them.
                    Browse available assets, connect with owners, and manage
                    your leasing activities in one place.
                </p>
                <a href="/listings" class="about-button">Explore Assets</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
            <div class="about-container">
                <h2>What is L-Ease?</h2>
                <p>
                    L-Ease provides an online platform where users can list
                    assets they own for lease and discover assets offered by
                    other users. The platform is designed to make it easier
                    for people to connect, communicate, and arrange leasing
                    transactions.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Unlike platforms that restrict users to a single role,
                    L-Ease allows the same registered user to act as both an
                    asset owner and a renter. You can offer your own assets
                    while also leasing assets from other people.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-features">
            <div class="about-container">
                <h2>What You Can Do on L-Ease</h2>
                <p class="about-subtitle">
                    Tools designed to support a more convenient leasing experience.
                </p>

                <div class="about-feature-grid">

                    <article class="about-feature-card">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">⌂</div>
                        <h3>List Your Assets</h3>
                        <p>
                            Create listings for assets you want to lease,
                            including property, vehicles, electronics,
                            furniture, tools, and other rentable items.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="about-feature-card">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">⌕</div>
                        <h3>Discover Assets</h3>
                        <p>
                            Browse available listings and use search filters
                            to find assets that suit your needs, preferences,
                            and budget.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="about-feature-card">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">↔</div>
                        <h3>Manage Lease Requests</h3>
                        <p>
                            Submit lease requests as a renter and manage
                            requests for your own listings as an asset owner.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="about-feature-card">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">✉</div>
                        <h3>Communicate Directly</h3>
                        <p>
                            Use the platform's messaging features to
                            communicate with other users about leasing
                            arrangements.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="about-feature-card">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">★</div>
                        <h3>Share Reviews</h3>
                        <p>
                            Submit ratings and reviews to help other users
                            learn about experiences with people they lease
                            assets from or to.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="about-feature-card">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">▣</div>
                        <h3>Manage Your Account</h3>
                        <p>
                            Access your dashboard to manage your profile,
                            listings, lease activities, and other account
                            information.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-how">
            <div class="about-container">
                <h2>How L-Ease Works</h2>

                <div class="about-steps">

                    <div class="about-step">
                        <span>01</span>
                        <h3>Create an Account</h3>
                        <p>Register and set up your user profile.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-step">
                        <span>02</span>
                        <h3>Browse or List</h3>
                        <p>Find assets to lease or publish your own listing.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-step">
                        <span>03</span>
                        <h3>Connect and Request</h3>
                        <p>Communicate with other users and submit lease requests.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-step">
                        <span>04</span>
                        <h3>Manage the Lease</h3>
                        <p>Track your leasing activities through the platform.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-cta">
            <div class="about-container">
                <h2>Ready to Explore L-Ease?</h2>
                <p>
                    Discover available assets or share something you own
                    with people who may need it.
                </p>
                <a href="/listings" class="about-button">Browse Assets</a>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <%- include("partials/footer") %>

    <%- include("partials/scripts") %>

</body>
</html>
